(15,'KEEP',[III,IV,V],'numerical','Microwave heating curve through ice, water and vapor regimes','Initial temperature, power, mass, dry fraction and dry heat capacity are supplied. Ordinary calorimetry, latent heat, vapor/pressure relation and energy balance determine piecewise temperature-time curves under declared absorption/container/steam conventions.'),
